Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Trace design, procurement, trade interfaces, and schedule dependencies using exact project graphs. Judge which dependencies are materially affected, distinguish potential from confirmed delay, and identify evidence needed to support commercial or timing claims.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
